---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Banner Placement">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Banner Placement</h1>

    <h2>Section Selection</h2>
    <p>Choose where your banner appears on your store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Homepage</li>
      <li>Collections pages</li>
      <li>Product pages</li>
      <li>Cart page</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Different page types serve different purposes. Use hero banners on the homepage, product-specific banners on product pages, and promotional banners on the cart page to maximize conversions.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Target Positioning</h2>
    <p>Precisely place your banner using our visual targeting tool:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Click the <strong>Target</strong> button</li>
      <li>Navigate to your live store page</li>
      <li>Hover over different page regions to see placement previews</li>
      <li>Click to select desired position</li>
      <li>Accept placement to return to settings</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> The targeting tool shows you exactly how your banner will look in its final position before you publish it.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Display Rules</h2>
    <p>Set conditions for banner visibility:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Show only for products with specific rules</li>
      <li>Filter by tags</li>
      <li>Filter by brands/vendors</li>
      <li>Filter by collection</li>
      <li>Filter by product type</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h3>Use Cases for Display Rules</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Seasonal Products:</strong> Show winter collection banners only on winter product pages</li>
        <li><strong>Brand Promotions:</strong> Target specific vendor promotions to relevant products</li>
        <li><strong>Category-Specific:</strong> Display category banners only on related collections</li>
        <li><strong>New Arrivals:</strong> Use tags to show special banners for new products</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Preview Your Placement</h2>
    <p>Use the preview button to see your banner in its actual position on your live website before publishing.</p>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Best Practice:</strong> Always preview your banner on both desktop and mobile devices to ensure proper placement across all screen sizes.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href="/docs/settings" class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Banner Settings
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/advanced-features" class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Advanced Features →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
